## Motivation

Closes #3099.

Discussion @ #3047.

Allows one to specify the private key to use for broadcasting transactions in a script.

## Solution

Example usage:
```solidity
vm.startBroadcast(vm.envUint("PRIVATE_KEY"));
// broadcast all the things
vm.stopBroadcast();
```
or:
```solidity
string memory mnemonic = vm.envString("MNEMONIC");
uint256 deployerPrivateKey = vm.deriveKey(mnemonic, 0);

vm.broadcast(deployerPrivateKey);
// broadcast one thing
```

